  "Description": {
    "Cost": 3931188,
    "UIName": "Kit Fox",
    "Id": "chassisdef_kit_fox_KF-XPR",
    "Name": "Kit Fox",
    "Details": "Reportedly piloted by Brett Andrews, the Kit Fox XPR, also known as the Purifier, mounts an ER large laser and ER small laser in each side torso, supported by a machine gun carried in each arm, fed by two and half tons of machine gun ammunition. Four extra double heat sinks maintain a high rate of laser fire.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.02</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
