  "StockRole": "Scout",
  "YangsThoughts": "A Light Clan OmniMech, the 30 ton Kit Fox was introduced in 2890 by Clan Cloud Cobra. Favouring a mix of firepower and armor over speed, the Kit Fox is powered by a 180 XL Engine and features a mix of Endo Steel and Ferro-Fibrous; giving it 16 tons of pod space. The Kit Fox Prime is armed with a LB/5X and an ER Large Laser. A Small Pulse Laser and a Streak SRM-4 round out the variant.",
